    [CI] Add DSV4.1 PCP DSpark nightly coverage (#19074)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Add a single-node A3-560T nightly case for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash W8A8 +
    DSpark + PCP, covering GPQA Diamond accuracy. Register the case and add
    it to the nightly documentation.
    
    Runner `/dev/shm` configuration:
    [ascend-gha-runners/docs#298](https://github.com/ascend-gha-runners/docs/issues/298).
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. Nightly test coverage only.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - [Nightly
    CI](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/actions/runs/39575052194/job/119140571586)
    passed at `fc66cffd4`: GPQA Diamond 198/198 completed, accuracy
    **91.41%** (baseline 88 ± 5).
    
